outcome: any
config: |
  SPECIFICATION Spec
  PROPERTY Prop
  CHECK_DEADLOCK FALSE
---*)
---- MODULE live_self_loops__weak__implied_weak_step ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLE x
Next == x' \in {x, (x + 1) % 3}
Spec == x = 0 /\ [][Next]_x /\ WF_x(Next)
Prop == WF_x(x = 0 /\ Next)
====

